            {
                "entry_id": "be81d708-b4ff-3a7a-90df-de758e54a227",
                "word": "FCK",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c933f318-c5e5-38ff-9625-d362c3887846",
                        "entry_id": "be81d708-b4ff-3a7a-90df-de758e54a227",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of FC København (“FC Copenhagen”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "initialism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a8ba52b-3d76-441b-a4d9-f9e0d5676f11",
                                "sense_id": "c933f318-c5e5-38ff-9625-d362c3887846",
                                "text": "It came down to the penultimate game of the year, FCK away at Brondby, and Brondby blew it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f345d05-0eea-4862-bb25-91fadf58749f",
                                "sense_id": "c933f318-c5e5-38ff-9625-d362c3887846",
                                "text": "This did not deter Flemming Østergaard, a charismatic businessman that led the takeover of FC Copenhagen (FCK) in 1997, from embarking on a similar diversification strategy (Storm, 2009). FCK went on to purchase the Danish national stadium, Parken, took up property investments, a bought a chain of fitness centres (fitness.dk) and two large vactations resorts, one of them close to the LEGOLAND Theme Park in Billund."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e356438c-db88-4178-b013-913b2920dd30",
                                "sense_id": "c933f318-c5e5-38ff-9625-d362c3887846",
                                "text": "An FCK soccer scarf was draped over a chair."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf52cb63-6d46-4c50-a4b8-8b339265e437",
                                "sense_id": "c933f318-c5e5-38ff-9625-d362c3887846",
                                "text": "It's therefore worth spending time at the website of FC København. You can browse FCK TV, OM FCK, which is presumably a Zen-like activity that Sting and Trudie Styler would enjoy, and have a MIT FCK. There are FCK highlights, KlubFCK, and FCK Away. There's something for everyone."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "717c1fb5-0dbc-38d9-a775-2e3940a42e82",
                        "entry_id": "be81d708-b4ff-3a7a-90df-de758e54a227",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of 1. FC Kaiserslautern."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "initialism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0eabe43-7c98-4783-ade8-04ded7a76b2c",
                                "sense_id": "717c1fb5-0dbc-38d9-a775-2e3940a42e82",
                                "text": "Sportarztebund Rheinland/Pfalz (chmn. since 1964), assn. and team med. doctor for 1st FCK Kaiserslautern (football club)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44b1ec17-33e5-4535-8060-19cf0cc9dd52",
                                "sense_id": "717c1fb5-0dbc-38d9-a775-2e3940a42e82",
                                "text": "This was my first opportunity to meet FCK supporters, and I was intoxicated by their merch table before I even entered the stadium."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29db5122-9e29-4d34-b42b-a14ecd6a18e7",
                                "sense_id": "717c1fb5-0dbc-38d9-a775-2e3940a42e82",
                                "text": "FC Kaiserslautern (FCK) was the first football club in the Bundesliga (German Federal Football League) to create a team, initially, and then a section for women's football."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
